Package: datajudr
Type: Package
Title: R Client for the DataJud API (CNJ)
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: person("Thiago", "Miranda", email = "thiagofm.pa@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to query and download judicial process data
    from the DataJud platform (CNJ - Conselho Nacional de Justica). Supports the
    public API (APIKey) and the Elasticsearch API (Basic Auth), including the
    raw process index and the Datamart of aggregated metadata, plus the public
    'Painel de Estatistica' download endpoints.
